    {"type": "cause", "text": "The FY2026 decline came from a 1.0pp hit from cost of revenue and a 0.6pp hit from SG&A, as gross margin fell on unfavorable category mix and marketing spending rose [D483][D485][P25][P5]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Cost of revenue was 49.8% of revenue in FY2026 versus 48.8% in FY2025, and SG&A was 27.5% versus 26.9% [D435][D384][D437][D386]."},
